WEBVTT

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.420
What? Left? Right?

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.410
Left, right, left, right, B? A?!

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:24.670
HEEELP!

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.250
Kasumi
Saaya
Rimi

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.750
You're kidding, right?

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.210
Arisa
Tae

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.630
Kasumi!

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.460
Hiya!

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.460
Kokoron!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.330
What's the matter?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.960
I could see that frown all 
the way from the window!

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.580
Where'd your smile go?

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.810
We're planning on sponsoring 
our own show soon,

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.750
but it's turning out to be a 
lot tougher than we thought.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.080
What do you mean?

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.040
There's planning out the performance...

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.960
And the venue and the date...

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:44.040
There are just so many 
things we have to decide.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.630
Some of which being pretty unrealistic.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:49.830
Oh!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.040
You want to fly during your show?
That sounds amazing!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.000
You think so?!

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:54.500
Huh?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.210
I love it! And this, and this too!

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.750
This looks super great!

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.670
Which part?

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:00.830
What about Mortin?

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:04.540
H-hang on a sec! I'm vetoing all those!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.670
They're just random ideas we jotted down.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:09.120
She's right...

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.130
Tough reality.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:13.540
B-but it really did sound fun!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.750
Uh-oh, there's that frown again.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.510
I wonder what I could 
do to make them smile...

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:24.890
That's it!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.750
Kokoron?

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.250
Misaki! We're gonna put on a show!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:36.790
What?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.370
Ready?

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:40.580
Happy!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.990
Lucky!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.880
Smile!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.460
Yay!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:49.250
Um, sorry for all the 
trouble Kokoro's caused...

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.960
or, is currently causing...

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.080
Well, Kasumi hopped on that bandwagon too.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.580
Whoosh! Let's fly!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.000
And strum!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.050
What are they doing, anyways?

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.920
Um, practicing their flying...?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:02.930
Huh?

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.790
Focused training is key for performing live.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.170
I'll see you later.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:09.710
See you later...

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.250
We gained another idiot.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.350
Arisa-chan!

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.500
So you're gonna fly at your show?

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.290
What does that mean exactly?

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.460
Right?

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.790
How do your shows tend 
to go with Hello-Happy?

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.080
Huh?

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.670
Hmm...

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.750
Generally, Kokoro says 
something silly and random,

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.540
then Hagumi says something silly and random,

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:38.170
then Kaoru says, "fleeting,"

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.880
then Kanon says, "Huhhh?"...

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.720
And then I break it all down.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.630
Huh?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.470
Where's the compromise in that?!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.790
I just kinda do what I can,

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.580
though there's probably a 
limit to what I can do...

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.080
Why don't you think you can do it?

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:56.830
Hm?

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.250
We're Hello, Happy World!

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:01.580
The band that brings smiles
to people across the globe!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:07.170
Uh-huh... And? How do you think we're
gonna make PoPiPa smile with a show?

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.960
We'll do exactly that! Once they believe
there's nothing they can't do,

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.500
Kasumi and the others will 
be able to smile again!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.380
Well, we can talk about the specifics later.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:22.210
Time to withdraw for now!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:26.210
Let's meet up after school to plan!
Misaki, can you let Michelle know too?

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.040
Sure, sure...

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:32.460
I guess Kokoro hasn't realized that
Misaki's the one inside Michelle's suit.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.040
Okusawa-san's got her work cut out for her.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.380
Kasumi! Everyone!

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:41.380
We're gonna play our show soon, okay!

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.750
Two of the fairest stars in all the heaven,

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.580
having some business,

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:53.710
do entreat her eyes to twinkle
in their spheres till they return.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.170
Kaoru-sama!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.420
Excuse me.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.540
1 New Message
Emergency meeting!!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.080
Alas, I must depart.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.420
What?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.090
See you around, little kittens.

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.040
Farewell!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.790
She's so cool!

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:19.580
Oh darn...

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:22.670
I think I'm lost again.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.710
Kano-chan-senpai!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.080
Hiya!

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:29.380
Hagumi-chan!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.000
Did you get lost again?

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:35.300
Y-yeah. I got the message while I 
was heading to the train station,

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.670
but I'm not used to this road...

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:39.380
Let's go together then!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.250
Okay!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:46.630
I wonder what the emergency is today...

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.380
Our practice session is 
supposed to be tomorrow.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.640
We're gonna put on a show 
to make PoPiPa smile!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.350
Ka-kun loves the croquettes my mom makes.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.670
What if we bring in some rabbits?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.830
Tae-chan loves bunnies, doesn't she?

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.920
Oh! And I heard O-Tae really likes Mortin!

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.250
Is that a rabbit?

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.210
I dunno, but I think it'll make her happy!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.420
What else does she like?

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:17.040
Um, we need to make everyone from
PoPiPa smile, not just Hanazono-san.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.920
What if we give them all chocolate cornets?

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:21.120
Rimi-chan loves those!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.580
I've already got that here.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.290
That's our Kokoron!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.040
Plan

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.040
Uh, are those supposed 
to be chocolate cornets?

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.420
What's all that other stuff...?

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:30.590
Budokan

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.790
Wait, wait, we're going off on a tangent.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.880
We need to talk about the show!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.460
I think I've got the gist 
of what you're thinking.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.860
Something like this, right?

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.420
Ah, it's all clear now.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.380
I see!

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.540
I think I get it...

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:54.000
H-how are we gonna bring 
all of this together?

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.250
Kasumi said she wants to fly.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.540
Butterflies?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.670
No, feathers or wings, maybe?

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.920
The Spirit of St. Louis!

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.750
Which means... we'll be flying?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.750
Huhhh?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.970
If we're gonna fly, we should do it
in the big open sky, huh!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.390
Let's fly in the sky, everyone!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.390
My apologies- could you repeat that?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:24.080
Let's fly in the sky!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.520
As Shakespeare would say,

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.040
"O my prophetic soul!"

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.630
Um, Kaoru-san is afraid of heights-

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:33.250
But it's what Kasumi wants to do!

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:36.000
Yeah! Let's all fly and make Ka-kun smile!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:40.460
Y-you know, there's an old saying,
that yould never wake a sleeping bear.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:43.130
We make our exit being chased by a bear...

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:44.080
So fleeting.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.380
Sounds like fun!

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:48.460
Feathers shouldn't mess with our performance
as long as they're small.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.750
Kanon-san! Even you're going to fly?!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.880
Yeah, let's do our best!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.920
You'll see! There's nothing you can't do!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.040
Yes...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.640
That's right, Kokoro.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:06.710
As Shakespeare would say,
"Nothing ventured, nothing gained."

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.790
It's all clear to me now.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:10.420
That settles it then!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.630
Got it...

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:17.710
I'll go ahead and ask Toyama-san
and the others when they're free.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:23.450
And I'll deliver the invitations 
to the little kittens.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.870
Yamabuki Bakery

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.920
Look at your fluffy branches!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.430
A thief?!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:44.890
Yeah, we call her Rock.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:46.580
Huh?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.570
PoPiPa...

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:02.030
We'll come and collect you
before the stars glimmer in the sky.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.610
Welcome to Kokoro-sama's 
ship, the S.S. Smile.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.290
It's a ship!

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:34.790
I can see that!

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.210
A ship as a live venue?

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.460
We'll escort you inside the ship.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.460
Right this way, please.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.080
This is crazy!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:50.960
Whoa!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.250
It's so big.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.460
Amazing...

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.000
So shiny!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.670
This place is huge!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.670
Look, Arisa! A piano!

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:02.460
Don't touch it! That thing's worth a fortune!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.290
Uh, is it just us here?

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:12.790
Ready...

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.580
Ladies and girls!

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.820
Welcome to the S.S. Smile!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.920
"Goka! Gokai!? Phantom Thief!"

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:31.170
Tonight, you shall all delight in the
wondrous land of Hello, Happy World.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.040
Budokan

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.290
Mortin!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:53.870
Rimi-rin!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:54.960
They're flying...

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:32.830
Tell me, dearest, would you like to
accompany us for one more song?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.320
Yes!

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:40.540
Well then, to the sky!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.510
She's gone!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.170
The sky...?

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:54.270
Over there!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:59.230
Magnificent! Dynamic!! A Carefree World!

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:01.330
What the-?!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:02.330
It's a pink...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.960
...Bear.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.460
How could a bear fly?!

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.960
It's really flying! Look!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.330
M-Michelle?!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:27.290
It's Hello, Happy World!

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:36.270
As Goethe would say, "Just trust yourself,
then you will know how to live."

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:41.830
I am a bird. A goose, a grouse,
a guineafowl, a turkey, an ostrich...

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.570
Kaoru-kun, none of those birds can fly.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.380
What about a swan?

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.630
Yes! I'm a swan!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.540
It's all clear to me now!

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:51.990
Michelle, it's time to fly!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:52.990
Yay!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.960
W-wait, we're already flying!

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.210
Not yet!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.330
Here you are, Okusawa-sama.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.250
Huh? Wait, what's that?!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:09.170
I said I didn't want to fly!

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:21.170
Wait- Kokoro, your parachute!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.460
Oh my god, she's not wearing one!

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:39.630
A bear who can't fly is just a bear!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.250
Is something flying over there?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:02.310
Whoa! They're flying!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:07.920
Kokoro!

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:16.250
What are you doing?!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.080
I'll let out my parachute for now...

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:19.910
Huh?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.290
Oh no, oh no!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.090
There's no string...

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.540
...on this parachute!

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:32.960
Woohoo!
...on this parachute!

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:33.960
Woohoo!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:45.880
What's all this?!

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.830
Please remain calm, Okusawa-sama.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.000
How am I supposed to be calm?!

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:54.500
Don't worry, Michelle's been equipped
with Happy Flight Mode.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:55.710
What's that?!

00:16:55.710 --> 00:17:00.710
To change modes, it's up, up, down, down,
left, right, left, right, B, A.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:02.330
So I need to press those?

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:06.790
Up, up, down, down, left, right, left, left.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.380
It's left, right, left, right.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.460
Huh? Left? Right?

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:18.040
Uh, left, right, left, right, B?! A?!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.420
Where are those?!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.890
Okusawa-sama, please press A and B!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.250
I don't see those buttons anywhere!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:30.250
I can't do this! Heeelp!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:31.630
Michelle!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.460
Michelle!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.670
Misaki-chan!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.540
Why the long face?

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.670
Michelle, smile!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:57.050
Up, up, down, down, left, right, left, right.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.310
Bingo!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:06.480
Here we go!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.540
Now that's what I call a smile, Michelle!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.880
Michelle's face always 
looks like this though...

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.210
Time for the main event!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:51.420
This wasn't a parachute, it was wings!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:52.830
Look, Michelle!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:14.750
They're so pretty.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.830
You're right.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.500
I feel like I could do anything today.

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.250
I wonder if we made Kasumi 
and the others smile?

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.110
They've all got beautiful smiles on.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:00.500
Phew!

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.890
I thought we were gonna die out there!

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:05.220
Kokoron! That was amazing!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.380
What an amazing concert!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.330
It didn't even really feel like a concert...

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.750
You were flying!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.130
It's possible after all.

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:13.880
Let's do it!

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.000
You think you can fly?!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:19.290
It really felt like the world of
Hello-Happy from start to finish.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:22.040
We're gonna give it our all too!

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:24.580
Yeah!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:30.000
Once PoPiPa realize there's nothing they can't do,
they'll be able to smile again, huh?

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:31.630
Yep!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:38.000
There's nobody like Kokoro...

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:39.420
Huh?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.920
Michelle!

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.040
Are you okay?

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.080
What's wrong? Did you get motion sickness?

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:54.170
I think... my nerves... 
suddenly went... away...

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.790
Kaoru-san!

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:56.630
Huh?

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:58.360
Please, hang in there!

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:02.920
Oh my... Don't look so sad, little kitten.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:08.250
I... Did I become a bird in the end?

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.500
You did!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:14.080
I saw a pair of pure white wings
on your back, Kaoru-san!

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:15.880
I see...

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.080
I'm glad...

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.040
So fleeting.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:22.880
Kaoru-san! Open your eyes!

